{"availability":"available","full":"glizzykingdreko/Datadome-Movements-Display","name":"Datadome-Movements-Display","description":"Interactive visualization tool for Datadome movement data, designed to decode and display user interactions with GeeTest Slide captchas. Features include responsive design, shareable URLs via Base64 encoding, and data persistence for enhanced analysis and collaboration. Deployed on Vercel for easy access.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":3,"created":"2024-03-02T15:47:53Z","updated":"2024-03-02T17:04:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://datadome-movements-display.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://datadome-movements-display.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.825Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.825Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.825Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.825Z","stars":9,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project aims to help display the stored Datadome movements for the GeeTest Slide captcha. It visualizes movements captured during interaction with the captcha, rendering them in a scalable, shareable format. The input format is identical to the one used by Datadome, which is a list of JSON objects in the following format:","This tool is designed to assist developers and analysts in understanding user interaction patterns with captchas, potentially aiding in the development of more intuitive and secure captcha solutions. (lmao is to help u solving it)"],"features":["Datadome Movements Display","Interactive Visualization: Allows for the interactive display of Datadome movement data, providing a visual representation of user interactions with GeeTest Slide captcha.","Base64 URL Sharing: Implements Base64 encoding for movement data and window size settings, facilitating the creation of shareable URLs that encapsulate the visualization state for easy sharing and collaboration.","Responsive Layout: Features a responsive design that adjusts the layout dynamically based on the screen size, ensuring optimal usability across devices, from desktops to mobile phones.","Data Persistence: Utilizes localStorage to save the latest input JSON and window size preferences, ensuring that users can pick up where they left off in subsequent sessions."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/glizzykingdreko/Datadome-Movements-Display/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b383890eebc0ccbaecb215802b5b89230601616b243fd0a55578927a226b2d67","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.925Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.925Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This project aims to help display the stored Datadome movements for the GeeTest Slide captcha. It visualizes movements captured during interaction with the captcha, rendering them in a scalable, shareable format. The input format is identical to the one used by Datadome, which is a list of JSON objects in the following format:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/glizzykingdreko/Datadome-Movements-Display/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b383890eebc0ccbaecb215802b5b89230601616b243fd0a55578927a226b2d67","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/glizzykingdreko/Datadome-Movements-Display/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.925Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-03-02T17:04:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/glizzykingdreko/Datadome-Movements-Display/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:21.926Z","hash":"b383890eebc0ccbaecb215802b5b89230601616b243fd0a55578927a226b2d67","originalBytes":4752,"storedBytes":4752,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["project","datadome","display","license","movements","application","contact","contributing","deployment","features","vercel","git","glizzykingdreko","npm","codepen","data","description","feature","github","help","input","install","installation","j